		"description": "Comprehensive API testing collection for My Many Books. Includes authentication (AWS Cognito), authorization (CASL), audit logging, hooks system, and all CRUD operations.\n\n**Latest Update:** December 2025 - Added authentication flows, admin endpoints, audit logging, hooks management, and traceId correlation.",
